{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1000_p", "source_sha256": "043201fca11a1e9df7fd0b991c52238ee62c6086b952b366ec22586b5fa6cd6d", "ja": "（今日は人気作『アイドルヒーローズ』シリーズの\nリバイバル公演用映像の撮影日だ）", "zh": "（今天是为人气作品《偶像英雄》系列的重映公演拍摄影像的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "f126b55edd571039b0d81e417c4c03ce1c08eec7b46b14183c89ca07e7f0f0e1", "ja": "アハハハハッ！　みんなで踊るのって楽しいネ！\n最後まで立っていられるのは誰かナ～？", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈！和大家一起跳舞真开心呢！\n看谁能坚持站到最后吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fd2812b48f8a39dc9ebd982a4262f75acab786c13ad71c656753e990b53752b0", "ja": "エレナ、お疲れ様。\n久しぶりのデストルドー役、感触はどうだ？", "zh": "艾蕾娜，辛苦了。\n好久没演德斯特尔多，这次感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "6d3134f2ec748738d9e5ae4f25e4f49eae87b80e81487dad55dd507781260c18", "ja": "うん、とっても楽しいヨ♪\nイジワルな演技は、ちょっと考えながらだケド。", "zh": "嗯，特别开心哦♪\n虽然演使坏的角色时，会稍微一边思考一边演就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9c79bf59142edcf7c201f035e665ecabff9751aaf1cce1ad364f90ca45049329", "ja": "でも、上手にできてると思うよ。\nもちろん、エレナとは全然違う子だけど。", "zh": "不过，我觉得你演得很好哦。\n当然，和艾蕾娜完全是不同的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "e3cfd4d077cb49a926eaa02747ffab4b63e39933781aca375c28fa6d67c229fe", "ja": "ウン、違うけど、似てるところもいっぱいだよネ！\nデストル幹部の『エレナ』。", "zh": "嗯，虽然不一样，但相似的地方也有很多呢！\n德斯特鲁干部的“艾蕾娜”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "b66fd64b723692e30d8ec9d9ff8434ec72d4080e4a801b49f744e91178d45f0b", "ja": "サンバが大好きだし、すぐに踊ろうとするし、\n誰にでも話しかけちゃうところとかも、そっくり！", "zh": "特别喜欢桑巴，说跳就跳，还会跟谁都搭话，简直一模一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1007_p", "source_sha256": "60bac4fea020576f348f5113344d29bbae1808638681e7f26d58a056509a9a7c", "ja": "あはは、たしかにな。", "zh": "哈哈，确实呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "7ff089690ab77217c3aace3f29997a2290971b701b01c50bd44cbee5beb87278", "ja": "でも無理矢理ダンスをさせるのは良くないよネ。\nそこは全然違うところかナ？", "zh": "不过，硬逼着跳舞可不太好呢。\n这一点完全不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1009_p", "source_sha256": "069dd18bffe4e9de2c8dd0b2781757e6cafc1b5624fb9ec5052e1b5e8375d28c", "ja": "そうだな。そっくりなところと、そうじゃないところが\n混ざってるから、魅力的なのかも。", "zh": "是啊。也许正因为相像的地方和不相像的地方交织在一起，才更有魅力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "d88c88898acd4d67ed46b09007159433510d52a4c8000f9b2f8cc5a62382b010", "ja": "エッ？　{$P$}は、あっちのエレナが\n混ざってるほうがいいの？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}觉得，还是混进了那边的艾蕾娜比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "d08895fc0ec58ecd91b6de57fa281e32a347a403878ad8799275592f1c13aae2", "ja": "じゃあ、ワタシもイジワルになっちゃおうかナ。\nずっとサンバのリズムでお話しして～。", "zh": "那我也来使点坏吧。\n一直用桑巴的节奏说话哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "8b67c8f0cb9f9db5f56ba9d74c9c188c7aeb4d0edd916452c11b5c9ba13d1d49", "ja": "{$P$}も踊らせちゃうヨ。\nイヤって言っても、絶対踊らせるからネ♪", "zh": "让{$P$}也跳起舞来。\n就算你说讨厌，我也绝对会让你跳的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4f4a09a5296b93eaa2a29001e5eecfb75d6e56ce7aade6bbae517ac5bdd0323", "ja": "いや、別に意地悪になってほしいわけじゃなくて。\nそれに、そんなにたくさんは踊れないよ……。", "zh": "不，我不是想让你变得这么坏心眼。\n而且，我也跳不了那么多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "78eec9f0c10251be6eca5f317fb8fd0d5c1f983a95666139f16cd4dc72fd72f3", "ja": "ダーメっ！　がんばったご褒美に、\nワタシといっぱい付き合ってもらうよ♪", "zh": "不行！作为你努力的奖励，接下来要好好陪我玩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "5093829a4d4ea7d3a8e6799d9890f7db4dbaa6b38577fbae2e96bdee836bc90e", "ja": "でないと、許さないからネ！", "zh": "不然的话，我可不会原谅你哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "1994d06f29b0cb391f4c570fc6dc100395fad740a66046a75b421b0fa52b907f", "ja": "……なんて、ワガママ言ってみると\nデストル幹部っぽくて、イイ感じになるみたい♪", "zh": "……像这样任性一下，\n好像就很像戴斯特尔干部，感觉挺棒的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "f71d83f810cab214316045c9ddad0378097f43120afab77c0b77d6611faf0e72", "ja": "それじゃ、あっ、撮影再開だネ♪\nダンスタイムはこれからだヨ～！", "zh": "那就……啊，重新开始拍摄啦♪\n舞蹈时间现在才要开始哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0654_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9aed9c80509bc92b1ad95303ebe6723d53f4453645aa2c49a542aa41282f36bf", "ja": "（天真爛漫なエレナが見せる違った一面、か。\n今回はデストルドーも人気が出そうだな……！）", "zh": "（天真烂漫的艾蕾娜所展现的另一面吗。这次连德斯特尔多也会受到欢迎吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
